#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:13
msgid "二、一句话简介"
msgstr "2. One-Line Summary"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:15
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;一句话简介：一个教AI玩游戏的游戏   &emsp;&emsp;核心玩法：2D动作 + 养成 + 策略   "
"&emsp;&emsp;世界观：虚拟游戏 + 未来世界 + 反乌托邦   &emsp;&emsp;美术风格：民族风 + 潮牌时尚   "
"&emsp;&emsp;开发引擎：自研开源跨平台2D游戏引擎 [Dora SSR](technical-description/index.md)"
"   &emsp;&emsp;发布平台：Windows、MacOS、Android、iOS、Linux   "
"&emsp;&emsp;商业化模式：开源"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Summary: A game that teaches AI to play games   &emsp;&emsp;Core Gameplay: 2D Action + Nurturing + Strategy   "
"&emsp;&emsp;World Setting: Virtual Game + Future World + Dystopia   &emsp;&emsp;Art Style: Ethnic + Street Fashion   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Engine: Self-developed open-source cross-platform 2D game engine [Dora SSR](technical-description/index.md)"
"   &emsp;&emsp;Platforms: Windows, MacOS, Android, iOS, Linux   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Business Model: Open Source"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:23
msgid "三、故事设定"
msgstr "3. Story Setting"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:25
msgid "故事梗概（by：嗲）"
msgstr "Story Synopsis (by: Dia)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:26
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;在末日后，地面上一片焦土，幸存者人类苟延残喘活在地下。游戏公司为了解决冲突，开发了一款没有人能拒绝的沉浸式游戏。   "
"但这个游戏却是阴谋的起点，玩家进入游戏后很多年都不会回到现实社会。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;面对真正的苦难，游戏商喜闻乐见，他们的年轻人沉浸在虚拟的数字世界。而有一人看透了游戏公司的本质，他希望能改变这一切。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;After the apocalypse, the surface was reduced to scorched earth, and surviving humans barely clung to life underground. A game company developed an immersive game that no one could refuse, in order to resolve conflicts.   "
"Yet this game was the starting point of a conspiracy — players who entered would not return to the real world for many years.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Faced with real suffering, the game company rejoiced as their young people immersed themselves in the virtual digital world. But one person saw through the game company's true nature, and hoped to change it all."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:30
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;一张图看完所有设定 - <a href=\"/_static/L·S·D.pdf\">在这里</a>。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;See all settings in one image - <a href=\"/_static/L·S·D.pdf\">here</a>."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:32
msgid "四、玩法介绍"
msgstr "4. Gameplay Introduction"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:34
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;《灵数奇缘》项目初始策划的游戏玩法是：2D 横版动作 + AI 训练/养成 + 即时战术   "
"&emsp;&emsp;通过玩家亲手操作教会游戏 NPC 如何进行战斗，生成 NPC "
"自己的战斗思维。然后由玩家组建自己的战斗小队，通过小队成员共同合作完成任务和挑战。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;The initially designed gameplay for Luv Sense Digital is: 2D Side-scrolling Action + AI Training/Nurturing + Real-time Tactics   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Players teach game NPCs how to fight through hands-on gameplay, generating the NPCs' "
"own combat intelligence. Players then form their own combat squads, completing missions and challenges through squad member cooperation."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:37
msgid ""
"**2D 横版动作**   "
"&emsp;&emsp;LSD的游戏基础形式为传统的2D横版，并使用近现代+科幻的军事武器进行战斗。战斗操作以考验玩家反应力为主，要求应对不同的敌人属性以及敌人技能，找到时机即时使用相应克制的武器发动攻击。"
msgstr ""
"**2D Side-scrolling Action**   "
"&emsp;&emsp;LSD's foundational format is a traditional 2D side-scroller, using modern + sci-fi military weapons for combat. Combat gameplay primarily tests player reflexes, requiring responses to different enemy attributes and skills, and seizing the right moment to strike with countering weapons."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:41
#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:45
msgid "玩法-2D横版动作"
msgstr "Gameplay - 2D Side-scrolling Action"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:48
msgid ""
"**AI 训练**   &emsp;&emsp;LSD的游戏提供让玩家自行创作 AI 代码的功能，通过人工智能算法（包括但不限于：分类决策树、Q "
"Learning）采集玩家进行游戏的操作数据，生成决策树形式的AI逻辑代码，并以适合的方式展示给玩家。"
msgstr ""
"**AI Training**   &emsp;&emsp;LSD provides a feature for players to create their own AI code. Through artificial intelligence algorithms (including but not limited to: classification decision trees, Q "
"Learning), the game collects player gameplay data, generates AI logic code in decision tree form, and presents it to players in an accessible way."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:52
#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:56
msgid "玩法-AI训练"
msgstr "Gameplay - AI Training"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:59
msgid ""
"**剧情养成**   "
"&emsp;&emsp;玩家可以通过推进游戏故事、完成游戏任务，或是和游戏角色进行通讯交流，触发养成条件解锁人物能力（克服缺点）。并通过经营军事学园，招募更多的学员加入。"
msgstr ""
"**Story Nurturing**   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Players can advance the game story, complete missions, or communicate with game characters to trigger nurturing conditions that unlock character abilities (overcoming weaknesses). Players can also manage a military academy, recruiting more cadets to join."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:63
#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:67
msgid "玩法-剧情养成"
msgstr "Gameplay - Story Nurturing"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:70
msgid ""
"**即时战术**   "
"&emsp;&emsp;玩家训练完成配备强力战斗AI的学员角色可以编队投入战场参与实际的战斗，在战场模式下，玩家只能操作导师的角色替身，其余队员将以训练的战斗AI自动参与战斗，并在行动指令系统下由玩家进行战术调遣。"
msgstr ""
"**Real-time Tactics**   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Fully trained cadet characters equipped with powerful combat AI can be organized into squads and deployed to the battlefield. In battlefield mode, players can only control the instructor's avatar, while other squad members fight automatically using their trained combat AI, with players issuing tactical orders through the action command system."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:74
#: ../../source/gamedoc/project-description.md:78
msgid "玩法-即时战术"
msgstr "Gameplay - Real-time Tactics"
